<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/title> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "Class has target description."@en;
                                       a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
                                       rdfs:comment "Class has target description."@en;
                                       rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                                       rdfs:label "description"@en;
                                       rdfs:range xsd:string.
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
